      en: "Ilha dos Tigres is a remarkable feature of the geography and culture of Angola. Former island, now a peninsula. Dry climate. Former settlement. This natural area reflects the scenic diversity of Angola. Like many notable places in Angola, it combines regional character with wider significance. Thus, this place contributes to the diverse profile of Angola."
